{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）上午9時11分，警方接獲報案，指葵涌道往九龍方向、任合興工業大廈對開，有3車相撞，涉及一輛輕型貨車、一輛中型貨車及一輛小巴。意外中，有3男6女受輕傷，其中包括一名孕婦。救援人員接報到場為傷者治理，警方正調查意外成因。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，葵涌道（往九龍方向）近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692069161275392936724.png/hTpJdRnT7_tjGw2jCYpK_2EeLVoTXT--P6yGxT-shsU\"/><figcaption>綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191700880554987520421806.jpeg/TItw1HNKj3yKep1OQ6Iw2pILngDMnLRc1GhwpdRocKU\"/><figcaption>小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701029020897280136450.jpeg/-KKm85M37_0LzUQu4kNe41ah4-7BvmAJIkF1SgdBdUo\"/><figcaption>小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玻璃碎片散落一地。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701026164445184218693.jpeg/lv4qwQWuciiR1F8nvC1E3svZjvwL6mZFCS5nqSwuZ6k\"/><figcaption>玻璃碎片散落一地。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方安排拖車到場，將小巴拖走。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701467854016512931845.jpeg/ymDMhXCCxYvNYNmr-QRd4NJfg2te7wQCS3r2bW569m0\"/><figcaption>警方安排拖車到場，將小巴拖走。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，現場交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701470605611008857614.jpeg/6Egp3MURFLMLrpBDdNNDL07qq5splX3XetN_7F_Tf-w\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，現場交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701473252347904094357.jpeg/BUojs5i32J0ZSuRtO58HwK4N3arJS1xsIxeoIAYXqCA\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701476092022784791653.jpeg/i4OVnqhIweJvJCZ7Wb7sxbiKkQ4AA6c2fNTNZ1nUzWc\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有大批警員到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701479409848320870923.jpeg/zRQRsY5AyZ1YCMiNt6F426paidOdyxLq5-EQr8LhEK8\"/><figcaption>有大批警員到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車亦有到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701460165857280918025.jpeg/2AjeyNJB6TUtPj6q8ZF3suy-1_qwrhCDUet5_HTrefw\"/><figcaption>救護車亦有到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有大批警車戒備。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692066602618880823704.png/rYrweVWqeZwk1oc4gB99dPsVUMdwvDiWANjvNwDY7zc\"/><figcaption>現場有大批警車戒備。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191691742420668416032168.png/lN5qq_5AYLn0GCFjMLAwv_TtTIHBg6DOuTTx47k08eM\"/><figcaption>現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:01:05.944870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:08:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:48.113118+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:58:26.653982+00:00","content_hash":"0e463f44eedd511477a38916df5a0ebb8e7a57e39c8d9aebceaace868d3f2114","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}